/**
 * The icon set: Lucide's own glyphs, kept here as SVG markup.
 *
 * The EMS design system draws every icon from Lucide (24px grid, 2px stroke,
 * round caps and joins, currentColor). The React package is not an option in
 * a Blade application and a Blade icon package would be a new dependency, so
 * the paths are carried here instead - verbatim from Lucide, which is ISC
 * licensed - and rendered by <x-ui.icon name="…" />.
 *
 * One map rather than one Blade file per glyph so a test can check that every
 * name a view asks for exists: an unknown name renders an empty box, which is
 * the kind of failure nobody reports.
 *
 * Names are Lucide's. Add a glyph by copying its inner markup from Lucide;
 * do not draw one, or the set stops being one set.
 */
final class Icon
